which permission tier each operation belongs in (STU-10 §17).
git makes the line sharp: everything that stays in this repository is
recoverable by someone who knows git; everything that reaches a REMOTE
is visible to other people the moment it lands.

  read  detect
  read  status
  read  diff
  read  history
  read  branches
